<title>USA: Citrix, 3Com in marketing pact.</title>
<headline>Citrix, 3Com in marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citrix Systems Inc and 3Com Corp said Monday they entered a joint sales and marketing agreement.</p>
<p>Citrix and 3Com will conduct joint marketing and sales programs as part of the pact. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The marketing alliance will involve promoting Citrix WinFrame thin-client/server system software with 3Com's U.S. Robotics Total Control remote access concentrator and EdgeServer open computing platform, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
</text>
